<div class="relative h-56 bg-navy-deep overflow-hidden">
<img class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" data-alt="High tech shielded industrial and medical diagnostic cables with custom black and gray molded strain relief boots and vertical insert gold plated connector plugs arranged neatly on steel inspection table." src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuDtuApRohl-oYhAEMKyjGQiyh5Lkb0HHpSJgahyI2yu1mFRU2HjYtZH_9GO3wJ_UjD8AYfEY_QqnEno6YNKktjkGoHn9VCG_XMm4zekXnu_e5H8WZbPQMRyqCb8Iskb7qfP9wJKmRQqXhub2xmNWhgOOExC5b_eaiz1fl4LSOJPinwvhiLPQAYFz5G3IPjHdlai5h_9hnsSKWjZeCXT4UQuWg55grjRUPqAheuSd6et">
<div class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-navy-deep/80 backdrop-blur-md px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-white font-label-caps text-label-caps">
